CafeRecomp consolidated source origins

Consolidating code does not change its authorship or license. Retain the original
notices when modifying or distributing these modules.

src/recompiler
  Locally modified DolRecomp, revision 1bec3554ecc4817cf78319ca3d8a0669477f29fa.
  https://github.com/ExpansionPak/DolRecomp
  License: LICENSE-DolRecomp-GPL-3.0. Existing local CPU/emitter changes retained.
  The cafe_codegen tool is built by CafeRecomp's root CMake project. Its usage
  banner now uses the actual executable name instead of hard-coding dolrecomp.exe.

src/graphics/latte
  Portable Cemu GPU sources and adaptations from the user-supplied
  ZeldaWWHDRecomp checkout, revision 5c39d48912e90ba749beaa9136dd0e9b52a480ff.
  License: licenses/ZeldaWWHDRecomp-MPL-2.0 and module LICENSE files.
  CafeRecomp modifications: MSVC endian intrinsics and the C surface adapter.
  Active integration: GX2 surface sizing, alignment, tile selection, mip chains.
  Shader-decompiler sources are retained for further integration but are NOT
  connected to D3D11 yet. The WWHD Vulkan/Metal renderer is NOT the active backend.

src/libraries/fmt
  fmt headers from that same checkout; license: licenses/fmt.

src/compression/zlib
  zlib 1.3.2 from the previously pinned build dependency, now built locally.
  Original archive SHA256:
  bb329a0a2cd0274d05519d61c667c062e06990d72e125ee2dfa8de64f0119d16
  License: licenses/zlib. No network fetch required during configure/build.

The old complete dependency checkouts (including unintegrated WWHD runtime and
renderers) are retained in build/archive/third_party-before-consolidation-1010.
They are excluded from the active build and source-release archive.
